# Block Types — Dual Prompt System

## DB columns per block type

| Column | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `prompt_template` | Generates markdown (for PDF, DOCX, editor) |
| `pptx_prompt_template` | Generates structured JSON (for PPTX v2 pipeline) |
| `pptx_output_schema` | JSON Schema validating PPTX output |
| `slide_intent` | Explicit intent mapping (e.g. `recommendation_portfolio`) |

## PPTX prompt template rules

- Must start with "Generate a JSON object for..."
- Must contain "Return ONLY valid JSON:" + example structure
- Must match one of the `SlideContent` types from `pptx/types.ts`
- The `type` field in JSON must match the `slide_intent` value
- Use `{{variable}}` for template interpolation (report, assessment, axisData, companyContext)

## Adding a new block type

1. Add `INSERT` to migration SQL with all columns including `slide_intent` + `pptx_prompt_template`
2. Add mapping in `IntentResolver.ts` SECTION_TYPE_MAP
3. Ensure matching layout exists in `layouts/`
4. Update `BlockTypeRecord` interface if schema changes

## Intent selection priority

`DB slide_intent` > `IntentResolver block mapping` > `IntentResolver section mapping` > `appendix`
